{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/20/4991521/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、絢音と浅草に行ってきました\nじょしらくが2人共お休みだったので\nお仕事の合間に行こうってなって\n行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"壱番屋さんの果実氷とっても美味！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲見世通りは平日でもたくさんの人が\n観光をしていました。\n外国人の方がやはり多かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公園を見つけて「ブランコ乗ろう！」\nという話になりこの歳になって\n公園でたくさんはしゃいじゃいました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブランコで大笑いしながら\n隣の小さい子に負けないくらい\n乗っていました(^-^)/笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/20/4991521/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って渡ろうとするも\n久々に遊具で遊んだので\n怖くて足が一歩踏み出せないよ〜の写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとは東京スカイツリーへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食品サンプル展を見つけ\n2人で大はしゃぎでいろいろと\n見ていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらく終わりに\nご褒美としてまた来る約束を\nしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浅草の雰囲気は私達に合ってるね〜\nなんて話しながらいい息抜きに\nなりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふうううううう！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしかったああああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/20/4991521/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 2ndアルバム それぞれの椅子\n見えないところに写ってます\n悔しいけど、見つけてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/05/20/4991521/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影中は未央奈とずっと一緒にいたよ〜\n未央奈お泊まり早くしようね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎みりターン◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーたんたん⊿牛タンタンさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛はお肉派らしいけど好きなお肉は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→豚肉、鶏肉が好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れんれんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・お願いしたら塩対応してくれますか？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→もちろん塩対応しますよ＼(^o^)／笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛知のコウジ（のぎざか会）さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・疲れている時のリフレッシュ方法は何かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→お風呂に長時間入る！\n音楽をひたすら聴く！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けんけんぱさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛は何月が苦手？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→7〜8月かな...\n日差しが強いと必ず頭痛くなって\n体調崩しやすいので苦手です(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tomoさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・個握に生誕Tシャツ着て行ったら変ですかね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→むしろ着てきてる方たくさんいます！\n着てきてくださるのすごく嬉しい(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただゆきさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・授業中最近すごく眠くなるけどなにか対策とかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→私も眠くなっちゃう(>_<)\nぺしぺし自分を叩き起こします。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりあんさーは圧倒的お肉派が\n多かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肉love。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のみりあんさーはお休みします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}